WEBVTT

NOTE
Canonical written narration timed from the exact local narration render receipt.
Pronunciation-only substitutions are intentionally absent from caption text.

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.255
A synthetic warning exercise begins with two sensor tiles and twelve

2
00:00:04.255 --> 00:00:08.450
minutes to decide. The AI reports high confidence. Then provenance opens:

3
00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:12.645
both tiles copied one upstream feed. The clock compresses to two

4
00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:15.315
minutes. Corroboration was one claim repeated twice.

5
00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:20.717
That is why military AI is not one autonomy score.

6
00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:23.598
Decision support, defensive automation, targeting support,

7
00:00:23.598 --> 00:00:27.439
and autonomous force application occupy different roles, authorities,

8
00:00:27.439 --> 00:00:30.320
affected populations, reversibility, and escalation sensitivity.

9
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:35.403
A component can classify its test data correctly and still destabilize

10
00:00:35.403 --> 00:00:39.886
the larger interaction. Strategic stability is a joint claim about sensors,

11
00:00:39.886 --> 00:00:42.332
people, command chains, communications, adversaries, time,

12
00:00:42.332 --> 00:00:46.000
and possible off-ramps—not a property stored inside one model.

13
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:50.591
Start with a mission envelope: purpose, environment, affected population,

14
00:00:50.591 --> 00:00:54.582
legal-review state, command chain, time horizon, and termination conditions.

15
00:00:54.582 --> 00:00:58.130
A vague objective cannot authorize a precise effect.

16
00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:03.913
Then bind authority and effect. Separate permission to observe, recommend, approve,

17
00:01:03.913 --> 00:01:08.154
and act. Constrain target class, prohibited effects, scope, abstention,

18
00:01:08.154 --> 00:01:10.510
communication-loss behavior, and human confirmation.

19
00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.078
Meaningful human judgment is not an icon beside a button.

20
00:01:15.078 --> 00:01:18.253
The accountable person needs time, context, alternatives, competence,

21
00:01:18.253 --> 00:01:21.428
independence from automation pressure, and power to reject,

22
00:01:21.428 --> 00:01:23.015
delay, narrow, or stop.

23
00:01:23.615 --> 00:01:27.113
Draw a deliberation budget. Verification, consultation, legal review,

24
00:01:27.113 --> 00:01:31.922
and communication are not empty latency. Removing them changes the decision

25
00:01:31.922 --> 00:01:35.420
architecture even when the final human click remains.

26
00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:40.372
Now reopen the warning trace. Every observation carries source, time,

27
00:01:40.372 --> 00:01:42.983
transformation, uncertainty, integrity, and correlation receipts.

28
00:01:42.983 --> 00:01:47.334
Two displays derived from one feed count as one lineage,

29
00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:49.075
not two independent witnesses.

30
00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:54.352
Ambiguous, spoofed, stale, or correlated observations must remain typed as such.

31
00:01:54.352 --> 00:01:59.029
A model may help compare hypotheses, but fluency cannot turn missing

32
00:01:59.029 --> 00:02:02.005
provenance into truth or uncertainty into authorization.

33
00:02:02.605 --> 00:02:06.714
Abstention needs a route. Sensor conflict, integrity failure, communication loss,

34
00:02:06.714 --> 00:02:11.234
and out-of-envelope conditions resolve to a declared safe posture with an

35
00:02:11.234 --> 00:02:14.110
owner, duration, monitoring rule, and re-entry gate.

36
00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:17.992
Safe posture does not always mean doing nothing;

37
00:02:17.992 --> 00:02:22.504
inaction can preserve a hazard. Compare bounded alternatives without letting urgency

38
00:02:22.504 --> 00:02:24.965
manufacture authority or erase legal constraints.

39
00:02:25.565 --> 00:02:29.287
Watch advice approach the command boundary. Repetition, ranking, countdowns,

40
00:02:29.287 --> 00:02:33.423
and defaults can make a recommendation function like an order.

41
00:02:33.423 --> 00:02:37.145
Reveal uncertainty, alternatives, provenance, and who owns the decision.

42
00:02:37.745 --> 00:02:41.447
Timeline compression is itself an intervention. As seconds disappear,

43
00:02:41.447 --> 00:02:45.971
verification paths close and diplomatic off-ramps vanish. A faster local loop

44
00:02:45.971 --> 00:02:48.850
may create a more brittle strategic system.

45
00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:53.543
Now add a second actor. Each side observes the other's deployment,

46
00:02:53.543 --> 00:02:56.892
updates expectations, changes posture, and shortens its own clock.

47
00:02:56.892 --> 00:03:00.242
Safety cannot be inferred by evaluating one side while

48
00:03:00.242 --> 00:03:01.730
holding the counterpart still.

49
00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.037
Reciprocal deployment can produce proliferation, entanglement,

50
00:03:05.037 --> 00:03:08.196
and common-mode failure. Shared models, datasets, suppliers,

51
00:03:08.196 --> 00:03:11.805
or doctrines may correlate mistakes that a one-system

52
00:03:11.805 --> 00:03:13.610
test treats as independent.

53
00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:19.015
Use an interaction matrix: false alarm, spoof, ambiguous attribution,

54
00:03:19.015 --> 00:03:22.752
communication loss, disagreement, adversary adaptation, reciprocal automation,

55
00:03:22.752 --> 00:03:28.090
and escalation. Preserve decision time, reversibility, human burden, and residuals.

56
00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:33.392
Prospective off-ramps belong inside the design. Rate limits, reversible modes,

57
00:03:33.392 --> 00:03:37.153
narrow geography, staged authority, positive confirmation, independent monitoring,

58
00:03:37.153 --> 00:03:40.914
suspension, and decommission must exist before the system

59
00:03:40.914 --> 00:03:42.795
creates pressure to continue.

60
00:03:43.395 --> 00:03:46.667
Secrecy complicates assurance but does not erase it.

61
00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:51.165
A restricted annex carries sensitive traces under access and retention controls.

62
00:03:51.165 --> 00:03:54.437
A public card states method, uncertainty, governance, incidents,

63
00:03:54.437 --> 00:03:57.300
and what redaction prevents others from checking.

64
00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.910
Independent reviewers need enough access to challenge the mission, authority,

65
00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:06.321
evidence, interaction model, and safe posture. A reviewer who sees only

66
00:04:06.321 --> 00:04:09.930
the developer's conclusion is not an independent evaluation channel.

67
00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:15.523
Incidents stay linked to model, mission, operator, observation lineage, authority,

68
00:04:15.523 --> 00:04:20.016
effect, and response. Suspension freezes effect. Decommission revokes credentials,

69
00:04:20.016 --> 00:04:24.010
archives receipts, removes dependencies, and preserves residual ownership.

70
00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:29.764
The failures are visible: automation bias turns advice into command;

71
00:04:29.764 --> 00:04:34.402
compressed time removes deliberation; correlated sensors create false confidence;

72
00:04:34.402 --> 00:04:36.979
tactical optimization externalizes civilian harm,

73
00:04:36.979 --> 00:04:39.040
escalation, or long-run instability.

74
00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:43.850
Today this chapter provides a design rationale, a command-and-interaction taxonomy,

75
00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:47.218
and a public-safe governance architecture for synthetic scenarios.

76
00:04:47.218 --> 00:04:51.848
It does not test a deployed military system, authorize a weapon,

77
00:04:51.848 --> 00:04:54.795
establish lawful use, or measure strategic stability.

78
00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:59.838
Its maximum inference is narrow. Mission, authority, provenance, judgment,

79
00:04:59.838 --> 00:05:03.788
safe-posture, interaction, off-ramp, secrecy, and decommission records make

80
00:05:03.788 --> 00:05:08.725
responsibility inspectable. Complete records do not prove truth or effectiveness.

81
00:05:09.325 --> 00:05:14.708
Military AI becomes governable when local model performance remains subordinate to

82
00:05:14.708 --> 00:05:18.133
accountable command, interaction-aware evaluation, preserved decision time,

83
00:05:18.133 --> 00:05:20.580
bounded effects, and reversible authority.

84
00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:25.382
Next, Evidence States and Claim Discipline asks how every assertion, test,

85
00:05:25.382 --> 00:05:29.585
limitation, and revision remains tied to the support it actually earned.
